UID: VS-RTL-INIT-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Ordered startup
STATEMENT: >>>
The simulator shall execute bounded, untimed blocking initialization once before event evaluation, with constant declaration initializers preceding at most one procedural initial block. Input-dependent or combinational-destination startup, concurrent initial blocks and timed startup shall fail explicitly.
