[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VS-RTL-CONTAINER-STORAGE-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Bounded native container storage primitives
STATEMENT: >>>
Internal native storage shall provide owned copyable dynamic arrays, double-ended queues and unsigned integral-key associative arrays with 1 through 256-bit elements and at most 256 cells. Allocation shall optionally preserve the existing prefix. Invalid reads shall return the element default and invalid writes shall be ignored. Two-state storage shall coerce X/Z to zero. Resource rejection shall preserve existing contents. HDL lowering, bounded-queue truncation and associative traversal remain outside this contract.
<<<
COMMENT: Focused native verification and limitations are recorded in docs/container-events.md. Broad array requirements remain Draft; this requirement does not establish HDL acceptance.
